{"unit_id":"tortoise014__dsh-tasks-panel#feature-1","repo":"tortoise014/dsh-tasks-panel","commit":"32bac45ccbed574e445c69f06daa5f09ff0e13ee","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tasks-panel 的功能「待办管理」：在侧栏面板添加带日期和时间的任务，并完成、重新打开或删除任务。新增事项默认设为当天，时间默认取下一个五分钟刻度。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:727-829","index.js:391-433"]}
{"unit_id":"tortoise014__dsh-tasks-panel#feature-2","repo":"tortoise014/dsh-tasks-panel","commit":"32bac45ccbed574e445c69f06daa5f09ff0e13ee","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tasks-panel 的功能「任务日历」：月历按日期标出任务事件，选择某天即可查看当天记录的新增、完成、重开、编辑或删除事件。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:990-1111","index.js:196-208"]}
{"unit_id":"tortoise014__dsh-tasks-panel#feature-3","repo":"tortoise014/dsh-tasks-panel","commit":"32bac45ccbed574e445c69f06daa5f09ff0e13ee","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tasks-panel 的功能「助手任务工具」：助手可通过 task_write 查询待办、添加任务、完成、重新打开、编辑或删除任务；操作与面板共用同一套任务逻辑。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:503-552"]}
{"unit_id":"tortoise014__dsh-tasks-panel#feature-4","repo":"tortoise014/dsh-tasks-panel","commit":"32bac45ccbed574e445c69f06daa5f09ff0e13ee","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tasks-panel 的功能「飞书到期提醒」：配置飞书群机器人 webhook 后，宿主定期检查同时设置了日期和时间的待办，在到期后的六小时内发送提醒；同一日期时间槽只推送一次。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:139-176","index.js:325-370","index.js:589-602"]}
{"unit_id":"tortoise014__dsh-tasks-panel#caveat-1","repo":"tortoise014/dsh-tasks-panel","commit":"32bac45ccbed574e445c69f06daa5f09ff0e13ee","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tasks-panel 使用前须知：飞书提醒会把任务标题、日期、时间和可选备注发送到配置的飞书机器人 webhook；不启用提醒则不会进行该推送（见 index.js:131-164）。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:131-164"]}
